{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000001", "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000002", "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000003", "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000004"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Clients stop responding to you and you don't know why. You're probably using one of these old tactics that makes you feel like a scammer to them.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000002"}], "text": "Some real estate tactics used by agents are outdated and can make agents seem dishonest to clients."}, "title": "Old Tactics in Real Estate", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics"}, "content_hash": "19a73c2b42c90eb47853578c98a7f0ba1b057bc471e9f8bb419c0cb7d5711527", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:knowledge:d2e94ef9d3d714f1", "metadata_hash": "292e63881dc46f742271f1475c1886d23c76ba9795b5457c57d77f4b9952a4c0", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-24T15:26:26Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "865fc42f7697339fb9cac19043f9f912a52570cf7f746cf41f9538f6a5f3b443", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcbYZohgvs6/", "title": "Old Tactics in Real Estate", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics", "topic_slug": "real-estate-tactics"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000001", "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000002", "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000003", "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000004"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "OPENING WITH PRESSURE \"It's the last unit. First come, first serve. The price will go up.\"", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000002"}], "text": "Opening interactions by pressuring clients with scarcity and urgency statements such as 'It's the last unit' can be seen as a scam."}, "title": "Tactic: Opening with Pressure", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics"}, "content_hash": "19a73c2b42c90eb47853578c98a7f0ba1b057bc471e9f8bb419c0cb7d5711527", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:knowledge:798567d6ea3c4056", "metadata_hash": "292e63881dc46f742271f1475c1886d23c76ba9795b5457c57d77f4b9952a4c0", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-24T15:26:26Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "865fc42f7697339fb9cac19043f9f912a52570cf7f746cf41f9538f6a5f3b443", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcbYZohgvs6/", "title": "Tactic: Opening with Pressure", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics", "topic_slug": "real-estate-tactics"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "ASKING ONLY ABOUT THE BUDGET \"No one bedroom for that. Only studios.\" You learned one thing about him and used it against him. He will never open up.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000003"}], "text": "Asking clients only about their budget and then using that information to limit their options can prevent them from sharing more information."}, "title": "Tactic: Asking Only About the Budget", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics"}, "content_hash": "19a73c2b42c90eb47853578c98a7f0ba1b057bc471e9f8bb419c0cb7d5711527", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:knowledge:1b667502129add62", "metadata_hash": "292e63881dc46f742271f1475c1886d23c76ba9795b5457c57d77f4b9952a4c0", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-24T15:26:26Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "865fc42f7697339fb9cac19043f9f912a52570cf7f746cf41f9538f6a5f3b443", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcbYZohgvs6/", "title": "Tactic: Asking Only About the Budget", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics", "topic_slug": "real-estate-tactics"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "ASKING FOR AN OFFER THE OWNER ALREADY DECLINED You just told him the owner said no to that price. Now you want him to offer it.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000003"}], "text": "Encouraging clients to make offers that the owner has already declined can be counterproductive."}, "title": "Tactic: Asking for Declined Offers", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics"}, "content_hash": "19a73c2b42c90eb47853578c98a7f0ba1b057bc471e9f8bb419c0cb7d5711527", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:knowledge:028ab8b4cd14fc62", "metadata_hash": "292e63881dc46f742271f1475c1886d23c76ba9795b5457c57d77f4b9952a4c0", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-24T15:26:26Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "865fc42f7697339fb9cac19043f9f912a52570cf7f746cf41f9538f6a5f3b443", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcbYZohgvs6/", "title": "Tactic: Asking for Declined Offers", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics", "topic_slug": "real-estate-tactics"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000003", "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000004"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "PUSHING YOUR STOCK He told you the layout, the size, what he wants. You send him whatever is available. He knows you're pushing your stock.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000003"}], "text": "When agents push whatever stock they have rather than what aligns with the client's needs, it can damage trust."}, "title": "Tactic: Pushing Your Stock", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics"}, "content_hash": "19a73c2b42c90eb47853578c98a7f0ba1b057bc471e9f8bb419c0cb7d5711527", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:knowledge:2fa51c2f590f8c2e", "metadata_hash": "292e63881dc46f742271f1475c1886d23c76ba9795b5457c57d77f4b9952a4c0", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-24T15:26:26Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "865fc42f7697339fb9cac19043f9f912a52570cf7f746cf41f9538f6a5f3b443", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcbYZohgvs6/", "title": "Tactic: Pushing Your Stock", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics", "topic_slug": "real-estate-tactics"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000004"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "WOBBLING ON THE NUMBERS Square footage. Price per square foot. Layout. You go vague on the numbers of your own project — and it sounds like a scam to him.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000004"}], "text": "Being vague about important numbers, like square footage or price per square foot, can be perceived as dishonest."}, "title": "Tactic: Wobbling on Numbers", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics"}, "content_hash": "19a73c2b42c90eb47853578c98a7f0ba1b057bc471e9f8bb419c0cb7d5711527", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:knowledge:711b732099429e71", "metadata_hash": "292e63881dc46f742271f1475c1886d23c76ba9795b5457c57d77f4b9952a4c0", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-24T15:26:26Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "865fc42f7697339fb9cac19043f9f912a52570cf7f746cf41f9538f6a5f3b443", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcbYZohgvs6/", "title": "Tactic: Wobbling on Numbers", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics", "topic_slug": "real-estate-tactics"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000001", "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000002"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "DUBAI AGENTS ARE SCAMMERS.\" A client told me this. This week.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000001"}], "text": "A client described Dubai agents as scammers in a conversation this week."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Client Perception of Scammers", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics"}, "content_hash": "19a73c2b42c90eb47853578c98a7f0ba1b057bc471e9f8bb419c0cb7d5711527", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:cases:d65d4c93e385f81b", "metadata_hash": "292e63881dc46f742271f1475c1886d23c76ba9795b5457c57d77f4b9952a4c0", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-08-24T15:26:26Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "865fc42f7697339fb9cac19043f9f912a52570cf7f746cf41f9538f6a5f3b443", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcbYZohgvs6/", "title": "Client Perception of Scammers", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics", "topic_slug": "real-estate-tactics"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000001"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "I’ve seen around 50 tactics in my career - selling myself, then coaching agents to sell. Some work. Some work sometimes. Most are old. Swipe for the 5 that get you ghosted", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000001"}], "text": "The text introduces the topic by stating the author's experience with various tactics and then promises to reveal ineffective ones that cause 'ghosting'."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "Introduction of Tactics", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics"}, "content_hash": "19a73c2b42c90eb47853578c98a7f0ba1b057bc471e9f8bb419c0cb7d5711527", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:expression:33f056b7fc11f656", "metadata_hash": "292e63881dc46f742271f1475c1886d23c76ba9795b5457c57d77f4b9952a4c0", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-24T15:26:26Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "865fc42f7697339fb9cac19043f9f912a52570cf7f746cf41f9538f6a5f3b443", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcbYZohgvs6/", "title": "Introduction of Tactics", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics", "topic_slug": "real-estate-tactics"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000002", "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000003", "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000004"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "1 OPENING WITH PRESSURE \"It's the last unit. First come, first serve. The price will go up.\"", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000002"}, {"quote": "2 ASKING ONLY ABOUT THE BUDGET \"No one bedroom for that. Only studios.\"", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:u000003"}], "text": "A numbered list format is used to categorize different sales tactics that are deemed ineffective, each with brief examples and outcomes."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "List of Common Tactics", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics"}, "content_hash": "19a73c2b42c90eb47853578c98a7f0ba1b057bc471e9f8bb419c0cb7d5711527", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628:expression:e1b0007b4ae24a94", "metadata_hash": "292e63881dc46f742271f1475c1886d23c76ba9795b5457c57d77f4b9952a4c0", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-24T15:26:26Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "865fc42f7697339fb9cac19043f9f912a52570cf7f746cf41f9538f6a5f3b443", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-08-24-hes-renting-your-4m-off-plan-md-82a6d29628", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcbYZohgvs6/", "title": "List of Common Tactics", "topic": "Real Estate Tactics", "topic_slug": "real-estate-tactics"}
